# Only the standalone LangGraph chatbot project is tracked from now on.
# Everything else at the repository root is ignored, including the old
# AGENTIC_CHATBOT experiments and local editor/tooling folders.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTIC_CHATBOT_WITH_LANGGRAPH/

# Common Python/runtime artefacts (also ignored inside the project).
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
